      "text": "Role in HTN:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " a thiazide (preferably thiazide-like: chlorthalidone or indapamide) = an initial-tx class; chlorthalidone and indapamide are preferred over HCTZ (higher potency, longer action)."
     }
    ]
   },
