        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Metolazone + furosemide (or other loops):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " unusually lrg or prolonged fluid and lyte losses; Zaroxolyn-type metolazone and Mykrox are ⍉interchangeable."
